# Optional settings. Nothing here is a secret and none is required for local use.
# SER_HOME      Move all data, models and outputs to another folder (used by the developer tests).
# SER_MODEL_PROFILE  Selects the active model profile:
#                     - "production" (default, promoted frozen 768-D emotion2vec+ with Logistic Regression)
#                     - "staging" / "candidate_option2" (296-D augmented SVM)
#                     - "svm_rollback" / "svm" (preserved 296-D acoustic baseline SVM rollback backup)
#                     - "emotion2vec_experimental" (isolated 768-D emotion2vec+ experimental profile)
# SER_CORS_ORIGINS  Extra website addresses allowed to call the API, comma separated, for a custom domain.
#   Example (cmd):  set SER_CORS_ORIGINS=https://your-domain.example
# Website settings are in frontend\.env.example (VITE_SITE_URL, VITE_CONTACT_EMAIL, VITE_REPO_URL, VITE_API_BASE).
